% layout 'auth';
% title 'Sign-in problem — MailMasker';
% stash brand_sub => 'Sign-in problem';
<h2>Something went wrong</h2>
<div class="error-banner"><%= $message %></div>
<p>Go back to the app you were signing in to and try again. If it keeps
happening, the link you followed may have expired.</p>
